⛔ `temp/` IS A SCRATCH DIRECTORY, NOT A MAXON PROJECT.

Suite logs land here, and the LSP and VS Code end-to-end cases stage whole fixture projects under it —
each with its own `build.maxon` and, often, its own `main`. Without this marker a root `maxon build` or
`maxon fmt` walks into them, compiles a dozen unrelated programs together, and rewrites the fixtures the
cases pin. Each case names its own staged root on the command line, and a named path escapes every
marker, so nothing here costs those cases anything.

The marker is a FLAG — this text is never read by anything. See `Compiler.collectMaxonSources`.
